window.products.push({"id":78153,"name":"Elroal Humidity Monitor by Digital indoor Hygrometer - Thermometer - Alarm Clock with LCD Display - Temperature Gauge Humidity Meter for Home or Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":48.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jVZ1rEI4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Descriptions We made an indoor thermometer of high-quality, durable materials so that you can easily and quickly determine the temperature and humidity in the room you need. Features & Benefits: -A stylish, weightless design is used in the digital humidity monitor with Digital Alarm Clock.  -A convenient and easy-to-use wall thermometer.  -A large, multifunctional, informative digital humidity monitor, so you can get the information you need even from a distance.  -Easy and quick for a couple of touches, the necessary information is displayed on the screen.  -Indoor thermometer saves the minimum and maximum values of air temperature and humidity during the day.  -Digital humidity gauge shows the exact time and conveniently set the alarm (every day / hourly alarm function).  -A loud signal in the humidity meter, it will be heard even in the next room.  -A very accurate sensor located in the hygrometer digital will help you to determine the temperature or humidity in the room to the tenth degree (percent).  -A wide range of measurement of air temperature from 32F to 160F and air humidity from 10% to 99%.  -The temperature and humidity indicators with the new wall thermometer are updated every 10 seconds.  -Convenient fixings of room humidity monitor will allow quickly and easily install it on any surface in the room. Specifications: -Dimensions: 3.8 inch (9.5cm) x 0.9 inch 2.2 cm) x 3.8 inch (9.5 cm).  -Indoor Temperature range: 50˚F to 158˚F (10˚C to 70˚C).  -Humidity Range: 10% - 99% RH.  -Temperature Display Resolution: 0.2 ° F (0.1 ° C).  -Temp Accuracy: ± 2 ° F / ± 1 ° C.  -Humidity Accuracy : ± 3%  -Power Supply: 1.5V (AAA Size) x 1","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jVZ1rEI4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elroal","source_asin":"B07BY3151S","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-78153","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BY3151S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BY3151S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
