window.products.push({"id":78342,"name":"WE49X20697 Dryer Bearing Repair Kit GE - WE3M26 Dryer Front Drum Bearing - WE03X29897 Dryer Belt - WE09X27634 Dryer Felt - WE1M504 Dryer Front Drum Sl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ptrO3si8S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💡 Ge We49x20697 Dryer Bearing Kit - A high-quality exact equivalent for part numbers - WE3M26, AP5806906, 3319945, PS9493092. The We3m26 Kit is compatible with General Electric and Hotpoint dryer models. Dryer Maintenance Kit We49x20697 includes components: 1 x WE3M26 Drum Support Bearing, 1 x WE12M29 Drive Belt, 1 x WE09X20441 Duct Felt Seal, 2 x WE1M504 Front Drum Slides, 2 x WE1M1067 Bearing Drum Slides. It is important to verify the compatibility of the kit with your specific model. 🔧 DIY eTips Included - Not sure how to replace the part? Helpful information can be found on the page below. Scroll down to get more repair tips. Acquire valuable skills during the DIY repair project. Ge Part We3m26 is constructed from robust and superior quality materials, which ensures that the dryer functions smoothly and has a longer lifespan. WE3M26 can restore the dryer's smooth and quiet operation by replacing the drum support bearing. 💡 Ge We3m26 Front Bearing Kit helps the front of the drum glide smoothly on the felt seal of the front panel while rotating. The front drum support bearing attaches onto the inside of the dryer front panel. Ge We3m26 Kit is made of durable and high-quality material that ensures the smooth operation and prolongs the life of the dryer. Our We3m26 Bearing Kit meets or exceeds all manufacturer specifications. We provide a lifetime warranty and guarantee 100% money back. 💡 Ge Dryer We3m26 Kit is constructed with durable materials and is designed to withstand the wear and tear of frequent use. The WE49X20697 Dryer Bearing Kit can solve four common issues with clothes dryers. These include making loud or squeaking noises, not tumbling, leaving marks on clothes, and taking too long to dry. If your dryer is experiencing any of these problems, you can purchase the WE49X20697 kit designed for GE dryers to fix it and restore it to optimal working condition. 💡 Is it worth replacing drum bearings on dryer? Yes, it is generally worth replacing the drum bearings on a dryer if they are worn or damaged. The drum bearings are a critical component that supports the drum and allows it to rotate smoothly during operation. If the bearings are worn or damaged, they can cause a number of issues. By replacing the drum bearings with new Ge Dryer Bearing Kit We3m26 , the dryer can operate more smoothly and quietly, preventing further damage to other components.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ptrO3si8S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PartsBroz","source_asin":"B07YSWPR9W","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-78342","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YSWPR9W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YSWPR9W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
