window.products.push({"id":78368,"name":"IKTCH 36\"Wall Mount Range Hood, 900 CFM Ducted/Ductless Range Hood with 4 Speed Fan, Durable Stainless Steel Range Hood 30 inch with Gesture Sensing &","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tC4aL88oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Feature: *10 years technical support on motor, 5 years technical support on switch control and LED lamps.*Four-speed Gesture Sensing & Touch Control Switch Panel*900 CFM powerful airflow capacity*19-gauge brushed stainless steel *dishwasher-safe, stainless steel baffle filters*high-quality workmanship *Ultra-quiet powerful motor*NO button noiseProduct Parameter:*Dimensions: 35.75w x 19.68d x 42.52h inches *19.7in + 19.7in length adjustable chimney duct *Vent Location: Top *Duct Size: 6\" diameter on top *1-15 minutes adjustable timer *2 pcs 3W bright LED lamp on front corner (adjustable brightness) *3 pcs baffle filters *Noise levels: Low speed: 40 db, high speed: 65 db. *Flapper: Yes *Voltage: 120V / 60Hz *Motor Wattage: 230W *Certification: ETL & CETL Compliance with the US and Canada Safety StandardsPacking including:1*IKP01-36'' Wall Mount Range Hood1*Remote Control1*Air Outlet1*Installation Parts and Screws1*6\" diameter by 78.7\" length flexible aluminum duct vent hose1*User Manualtips:1. This baffle filter has two sides, please note that the longer side is perpendicular to the display side. If it is installed incorrectly, the baffle filter may fall.2. Gesture control only takes effect when all the two sensing points are crossed, and the maximum distance range for gesture sensing is 28cm (11″).3. A distance of 24 inches to 36 inches is recommended between stove top and the bottom of range hood.4. The maximum height of the ceiling is 108 inches.5. It is recommended that the range hood be vented vertically through the roof through 6 inches (15.2cm) or bigger round metal/aluminum vent work.Please feel free to tell us if you have any problems with IKTCH Products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tC4aL88oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IKTCH","source_asin":"B08M5G8MQN","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-78368","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08M5G8MQN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08M5G8MQN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":78369,"name":"Pfaltzgraff Yorktowne Burner Covers for Electric Stoves, Set of 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51SDMT0ZCRL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Gray Background with Marbled Blue Flower Motif, Economy Burner Cover Set Amazon.com Decorate the kitchen in the sweet traditional image of the Yorktowne collection with this matching set of four burner covers. The classic pattern recalls the origins of Pfaltzgraff's German pottery created in York, Pennsylvania in 1811. With a charming touch, camouflage the electric stovetop when finished cooking with this delightful old-country design on each lid. Featuring a simple stylized floral motif, the hand-applied image in deep blue evokes the salt-glaze techniques of early crockery, matching the complete line of Yorktowne dinnerware and accessories, introduced in 1967. These two pairs of large- and small-sized tin lids are dishwasher-safe, though hand washing and drying should maintain the painted enamel design. Quality crafted, the products carry a three-year warranty against defects. --Roberta Cruger","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51SDMT0ZCRL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pfaltzgraff","source_asin":"B0001GUCVK","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-78369","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0001GUCVK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0001GUCVK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
