window.products.push({"id":78407,"name":"Upgraded W11307244 W10682535 Washer Lid Lock Door Lock Assembly by Sikawai - Fit for Whirlpool May-tag Ken-more Replaces AP6832601 W10838613 W10682535","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61esMd6tUQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【When Do I Need to Replace It ?】-- The Door Latch W11307244 (3 Wires) also called the lid latch, prevents the door from being opened while the washer is in use. repair the following symptoms:✔ Washing machine lid latch was not working✔ Washer lid or door won't close ✔ Washer lid or door will not open✔ The lock light flashes. Part W11307244 replaces W10838613,AP6832601,PS12704713,W10682535,AP5988772,PD00026475,PS11727984,4338530. ✅【W11307244 Washing Machine Door Latch Fits Models】-- 🔧Whirlpool:MVWC565FW0,WTW4616FW0,WTW4616FW1,WTW4616FW2,WTW4655JW0,WTW4655JW1WTW4715EW2,WTW4810EW1,WTW4810EW2;🔧May-tag:MVWC565FW0,MVWC215EW1,MVWC415EW1,MVWC415EW2,MVWC416FW0,MVWC416FW1,MVWC465HW0,MVWC465HW1,MVWC465HW2;❤For more details, please refer to the description. ✅【Easy Installation 】-- The W11307244 lid lock is a very easy fix that anyone with basic hand tools can do and save plenty of dollars Just spend some time watching the step by step video from Youtube.YouTube has plenty of videos of pros installing one of these, and it's super simple. Just do a search of the part # with \"install\" and you should easily find a video. ✅【LIFETIME WARRANTY】- If you have any problems or there is any damage to the product, we will offer a 100% money-back guarantee. Welcome to contact us, we will try our best to solve your problem. Customer satisfaction is our tireless pursuit. ✅【Sikawai is Your Best Choice】-- W11307244 W10682535 Washer Lid Lock Assembly Fits Many Whirlpool, Kitchen-Aid, Ken-more, May-tag, Roper Washing Machines.Product quality meets or exceeds OEM standards.Get a re-working washing machine for less money with your hands.❤Note:The washer lid lock has 3 wire, please make sure the wire count is right before you order.Please feel free to contact us if there is any uncertainty about the product type.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61esMd6tUQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sikawai","source_asin":"B09XB52MTQ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-78407","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XB52MTQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XB52MTQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
