window.products.push({"id":78488,"name":"YaungBass Ice Maker Machine for Countertop, 9 Ice Cubes Ready in 7Mins, Make 12kg 26lbs Bullet Ice Cubes 24hrs, Led Display Portable Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618DZtBVKPL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍧 Welcome to the world of the Ice Maker Machine. It was designed with fast speed and high efficiency, I can make 9 bullet-shaped ice cubes in an average time 7minutes. With a compact design, I can easy to move around your kitchen countertop or bring it to the pool, on your RV or boat or anywhere else that you want to have ice cubes right at your fingertips. Your summer party is sure to be made even cooler by this little machine! 🍧Here are some FEATURES about Our Ice Maker Machine: 🧊FASTICE-MAKING:9pcs ice cubes in 7min(120W) 🧊HIGH-EFFICIENCYCOMPRESSOR 🧊LOW NOISE: Ultra-quite operation≤45db 🧊EASYOPERATION LED INDICATORS 🧊EASY TO CLEAN 🧊PORTABLE WIDE APPLICATION NOTES ✅1. Before use, please read the user manual carefully and keep it well for future reference. ✅2. After receiving the product, please settle down the ice maker for 2-6 hours (Usually, 4 hours is enough) before switching on the power and using. Leave the ice maker at least 4 in/10cm away from any obstructions ✅3. The effect of ice making varies with water temperature and ambient temperature. It is suggested to put the machine in a cool and ventilated place, which will greatly improve the ice producing capacity. ✅4. If not use it for a long time, please remove the drain plug at the bottom to drain out the water and keep it dry. ✅5. The ice maker is insulated and by definition not a freezer. The ice will not be frozen in the machine. Please use it asap or shift to your freezer. Even if not used, rest assured that the ice will melt into water and continue to make ice. 🍧Package: 1 * CountertopIce Maker Machine 1 * Ice Basket 1 * Ice Scoop 1 * User Manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618DZtBVKPL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YaungBass","source_asin":"B09Z5S5194","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-78488","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Z5S5194","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Z5S5194","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
