window.products.push({"id":78505,"name":"Supreme Covers Portable Washing Machine Cover for Top Load Machines Durable Oxford Polyester - Washer and Dryer Covers for Sheds, Garages, Balcony (Sm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612SUcQ6tvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Give Your Washer the Star Treatment Truly the washer and dryer are the unsung heroes of the home. Shoved in a corner or outside, they quietly hum away, unthanked for their service. Here at Supreme Covers, we want to change that. Why not give your appliances a glow up? We make washer and dryer covers that add style to your machines and protect them at the same time. Here's what our covers do for you: ✔ Add waterproofing ✔ Keep dust bunnies away ✔ Fit a wide variety of machines ✔ Make cleaning your washer easy ✔ Take your machines from shabby to chic Universal Fit \"But Supreme Covers,\" we hear you asking, \"surely this won't fit my particular washer and dryer!\". Of course it will! We have washing machine covers for front loader, top loader, and almost any size of machine. As long as you're not using a bucket and washboard, we've got you covered. Designed for the Toughest Environments Unfortunately your appliances can't always live inside with you. Sometimes you have to banish your front load washer and dryer to the garden or shed. Although your machines weren't made to battle the elements, our covers were. You can protect your appliances from rain, wind, dew, and sunlight with our stylish covers. After all, everyone needs to cover up when they go outside. Don't Settle for Bland If there's one thing that appliance manufacturers love, it's the color white. While they try to outdo each other on who can make the most boring design, you can go your own way. With Supreme Covers, you can add a splash of color to your laundry room to make it a more fun and inviting space. There's no need to blend in when you can stand out in style. So go ahead and grab some Supreme Covers for washers and dryers, and give your appliances the thanks they deserve.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612SUcQ6tvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Supreme Covers","source_asin":"B08JD37BX9","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-78505","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JD37BX9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JD37BX9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
