window.products.push({"id":78638,"name":"30W Portable Washing Machine for Traveling,Automatic Cycle Mini Washing Machine Foldable Design USB Powered Portable Turbo Washer for Sink Tiny House ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51aYyf4s2DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MACHINE PRINCIPLE: Small Washer is mainly used to install at the bottom of the bucket or basin, with its own high-frequency ultrasonic vibration cavitation, and cleaning with the turbine. You only need to put an appropriate amount of detergent and change the water source regularly. The button operation allows you to complete the cleaning of small clothes faster. CARRYING DESIGN: Portable Washing Machine is made of high quality ABS and silicone material, made of safe material, non-toxic and odorless. The product size is about 9 x 9 x 5.5cm, mini design, easy to carry, can be well used to clean small items in travel, business trip, camping, picnic, free your hands. ULTRASONIC CLEANING: Travel Washing Machine uses high-frequency vibration and sound waves to clean, with low noise and will not disturb your rest and sleep. Sonic cleaning can accelerate the dispersion and emulsification of liquids and stains to achieve the purpose of full cleaning. The whole process lasts for 30 minutes after you plug in the USB power, it will stop automatically after 30 minutes, you only need to restart after one minute, you can continue to use it. AUTOMATIC CYCLE: Foldable Washing Machine supports automatic cycle cleaning, automatic forward and reverse rotation, and ultrasonic vibration cleaning. You only need to install the suction cup on the bottom of the basin or bucket, and connect the power to start cleaning. Ideal for cleaning small, lightweight items such as newborn clothes, underwear, rags, towels, small amounts of T-shirts, socks, etc. NOTE ON USE: Since the product needs to install the suction cup by itself, do not put it in a low sink or washbasin, etc., to prevent the situation of splashing water due to the inability to fix the washing machine. Install the suction cup on the bottom of a deep pot or bucket, not on a curved wall. Please place this product in a dry and ventilated place after use to prolong the service life of the washing machine.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51aYyf4s2DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KUIDAMOS","source_asin":"B0BD4HQKFT","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-78638","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BD4HQKFT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BD4HQKFT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
