window.products.push({"id":78721,"name":"Amastar A0406 Indoor Hygrometer Thermometer Portable Digital Temperature Monitor with Humidity Level Indicator","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yDYbIVfVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Amastar A0406 Indoor temperature and humidity monitor  The indoor thermo-hygrometer is an ideal measuring instrument for tracking room ambient temperature and humidity with daily Min/Max records . With the main display unit measuring 4.21 x 2.52 x 0.73in (H x W x D) , and the display that includes comfort and trend indicators. You can place the A0406 on your desktop, hang it on your wall or attached to a metal surface like refrigerator.  Comfort Level Indicator 1. Check indoor comfort and humidity with the humidity level icon. Comfort level indicator for humidity levels between 45% - 65%RH.  2. Maintaining ideal humidity levels of your rooms by preventing the growth of mold, bacteria, viruses, fungi, mites, and other asthma-inducing agents.  3. The comfort indicator shows whether humidity levels are dry, comfort, or wet based on relative humidity readings so you can adjust room humidity levels to protect your possessions and improve room comfort.  Adjustment or Calibration The purpose of calibration is to fine tune or correct for any sensor error associated with the devices margin of error. The measurement can be adjusted from the console to calibrate to a known source.  Package Contents:  1x digital thermo-hygrometer 1x user manual Features:  1) Indoor humidity and temperature (°F or °C)  2) Comfort level indicator for humidity levels 3) Rate of change icon of temperature and humidity 4) Minimum and Maximum temperature and humidity records 5) Clearing the Min/Max values daily or manually 6) Manually calibration of temperature and humidity 7) Indoor temperature range: 32°F to 140°F (0°C to 60°C)  8) Indoor humidity range: 10% to 99% 9) 2xAAA battery (not included)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yDYbIVfVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amastar","source_asin":"B0716JHJLT","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-78721","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0716JHJLT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0716JHJLT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
