window.products.push({"id":78826,"name":"Karinear Tempered Glass 12'' Gas Cooktop 2 Burners, Propane Cooktop, Natural Gas Burner, Built-in Gas Stovetop with Thermocouple Protection for Apartm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":134.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qzxJXAYkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🔥 【Propane/Natural Dual Fuel Gas Stove Top 】The initial setting of the 2 burners gas cooktop is for natural gas. If you want use liquid propane you have to change the NG nozzles into LPG nozzles. Don't forget to install our pressure regulator. All conversion accessories are included in the built-in gas cooker package. So you can call it 2 burner propane cooktop or natural gas cooktop. Note:If Amazon does't allow returns, please contact the seller. 🔥 【Tempered Glass Surface, Easy to Clean, Reventing Rust 】As we all know, stainless steel gas stoves are easy to get dirty, so we use glass material as the surface of our two burner gas cooktop. Black glossy glass, very easy to clean, just wipe with a damp cloth. The glass gas stove not only looks beautiful, but also has a rust-proof function. The 12 inch gas stove made of high hardness tempered glass can perfectly solve the cleaning problem. 🔥 【10236+5971Btu Powerful Gas Burners】This glass gas hob has two burners of different power and different sizes to suit different size cookers. Among gas stove 2 burners, the large-sized burners are also called rapid burners, with a power of up to 10236-BTU. Small size burner power is 5971-BTU. With our heat-proof knob, you can adjust the size of the fire at will to meet the flame needs of various foods. 🔥 【Thermocouple Protection and Electric Ignition】The thermocouple flame-out failure divice system(FFD) will shutoff the gas automatically if a flame is not detected to ensure your safety in an emergency. NOTE: If NG/ lpg gas stove 2 burners leak, check that you have replaced the nozzle and installed our pressure relief valve. The automatic electric pulse ignition uses a 110V AC power, and the 12 inch gas cooktop is very easy to ignite and adjust the heat. 🔥 【Modern Drop-in Gas Cooktop 12 Inch】The 2 Burner Propane/Natural gas cooker is drop-in design, modern and save space for you. Karinear 12\" gas stove top is suitable for small counters, apartment or indoor use. Please confirm the tempered glass gas cooktop size before purchasing. Product size: 12.2\" W x 20.08\"D x 2.75\"H, cut out size: 11.02\" W x 18.9\"D","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qzxJXAYkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Karinear","source_asin":"B0BCS8KSZV","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-78826","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCS8KSZV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCS8KSZV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
