window.products.push({"id":78904,"name":"4389102 Refrigerator Icemaker Emitter Sensor Control Board Kit Compatible for Whirlpool Maytag Kenmore Replace 2198586 2220398 W10757851 AP5956767 ADC","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6179yDPqpQL._AC_SL1002_.jpg","description":"This particular Electronic Control Board is specific to Whirlpool brands including： Kenmore,Maytag, Magic Chef, Amana, Admiral, Estate, Inglis, KitchenAid, Roper, Crosley, Jenn-Air, Hardwick, Glenwood, and Caloric. 4389102 Refrigerator Icemaker Emitter Sensor Control Board Kit Replace Part Numbers: 2198585, 2198586, 2220398, 2220402, 2255114, 4388635, 4389102R, AP5956767, AP3137510, PS557945, PS10064583, TJ4389102R, W10193666, W10193840, W10290817, W10757851. 4389102 refrigerator control board AKA w10193666 whirlpool,4389102 kenmore,w10290817 kitchen aid,whirlpool optics w10757851,whirlpool 2198588,whirlpool 2220398,whirlpool w10757851,whirlpool ap5956767,whirlpool 2255114,whirlpool 4389102. Replacing the Electronic Control Board could solve your appliance problem as below: symptoms: 1) The ice maker will not make ice 2) The ice maker will not stop making ice 3) The ice maker seems to have stopped working properly How To Replace The 4389102 Ice Maker Optic Control Boards  for Whirlpool: 1): Unplug the refrigerator.Remove the three Phillips screws on the right hand side. 2): Disconnect the wire harness on the back side and then remove the two screws to release the receiver control board from the housing. Re-install the receiver board in the reverse order. 3): Remove the three screws on the left hand side. 4): Disconnect the wire harness on the top side and then remove the two screws to release the emitter control board from the housing. Re-install the emitter board in the reverse order. Tips: If you are not a mechanic,we recommend you to take a photo before removing the old parts to avoid forgetting how to install new parts! Package Includes: 1 x 4389102 Icemaker Sensor Control Board Kit with Instruction Manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6179yDPqpQL._AC_SL1002_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TOPEMAI","source_asin":"B07TBM9GSB","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-78904","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TBM9GSB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TBM9GSB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
