window.products.push({"id":78999,"name":"Euhomy Compact Laundry Dryer 1.8 cu.ft, Stainless Steel Clothes Dryers With Exhaust Pipe, Four-Function Portable Dryer For Apartments, Home, Dorm, Whi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":279.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WrXqscjFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【High performance】This is powerful yet, euhomy portable dryer has a large capacity of 10.5 pounds(wet clothes). This dryer with 1050W power, It can reach a maximum temperature of 140°F, To ensure that your clothes dry quickly. And our portable dryers are quiet to use, so you can dry your clothes no matter what time of day.Note: Use after spin-drying, the drying effect is better./The dryer can serve two people/If you have more space needs, you can buy other products of this brand. 【Evenly heated】 This portable clothes dryer has a large-diameter, stainless steel and a special internal physical structure to deliver the best possible drying experience. These features ensure sufficient clothes rotation, prevent tangles, remove wrinkles, Evenly heated and leaves your clothes fluffy and comfortable.(In order to ensure the service life of the product, it is necessary to rest for 1 hour after working for a long time before proceeding to the next work) 【Multi-function】 Our electric clothes dryer has easy-to-operate knobs and seven drying modes: COOL DOWN (0-20mins): for delicates; WARM (30-120mins): standard drying; HOT (120-200min): drying bulky loads; ANTI-WRINKLE (30-60min): wrinkle prevention; AIR DRY (0-80mins); INTELLIGENT: Portable dryer can adjust the heating time according to humidity; ECO MODE: Save energy. 【ECO modes】starting with 150 minutes of cold air, followed by 120 minutes of hot air.In ECO mode, if the knob does not start to rotate from 70 minutes, you need to manually unplug the power supply, the dryer will stop working.Different from the normal temperature blowing in the last twenty minutes of normal mode, no matter whether SENSOR DRY is turned on or not, ECO mode will use the humidity sensor to judge in the last twenty minutes. If the clothes are not dry enough, it will be hot air. 【User-friendly After-sales Service】This portable clothes dryer is small in size (19.3 x 17.7 x 27 in )The dryer can serve two people/If you have more space needs, you can buy other products of this brand/, This portable dryer is ideal for small spaces such as apartments, dormitories, etc. ETL and DOE certifications guarantee the safety and quality of our products.We offer a one-year warranty on this Compact Laundry Dryer, if you have any questions or concerns,please contact us asap.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WrXqscjFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"E EUHOMY","source_asin":"B0C5MF7JRS","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-78999","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5MF7JRS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5MF7JRS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":79000,"name":"MAYITOP Clothes Dryer Timer Control Switch Knob with Metal Ring Compatible with WE1M654 General GE Electric,GE Hotpoint,Sears Kenmore Dryer 212D1726 A","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51BDbDgQWML._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"MAYITOP WE1M654 Timer Knob With ring for General Electric Hotpoint Dryer White This is a timer knob for your dryer. This knob is white with a silver trim, and is roughly 3 inches in diameter. You will need to replace this part is if your timer will not advance, or if your dryer will not start. No tools are required for you to complete this repair. To install this part, grab your old knob with a firm grip and pull. Make sure that during this first step the inside of the part has come off as well. Next you will align your new knob onto the D-shaped shaft and snap it into pla This part works with the following brands: General Electric, Hotpoint This part works with the following products: Dryer This part fixes the following symptoms: Timer will not advance | Will Not Start | Shuts off too soon | Will not shut off Part Number WE1M654 replaces: 1264290, AP3995088, WE01M0443, WE1M443, WE1M502, WE1M654, WE1M668.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51BDbDgQWML._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MAYITOP","source_asin":"B07D3R9GB1","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-79000","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D3R9GB1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D3R9GB1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
